  "body": "This PR removes gendered pronouns from examples and text. It leaves in gender in explicit book quotes, when talking about Hixie's cats (which he presumably knew the sex of when he wrote the text), or when a title explicitly genders a subject anyway.\n\nNo normative changes.\n",
